“God breaks us to bind us stronger. What He divides in pain, He joins in holiness.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/110109.htm
)

“A home ruled by pride will collapse; but one governed by love and truth will stand even in persecution.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/230119.htm
)

“When family wounds bleed, it is patience that proves faith.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0319.htm
)
